# Atlas — quotes & the cost calculator (Sprint 04)
# Run against: dotnet run --project src/Atlas.Api  (defaults to http://localhost:5000)
# Quotes are org-owned: authenticate first (register-org returns a token).

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Sign up — returns a token and creates the first OrgAdmin
# @name signup
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-org
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgName": "Initech GmbH",
  "email": "admin@initech.example",
  "password": "a-long-enough-password",
  "displayName": "Ada Admin"
}

### Capture the token from the signup response
@token = {{signup.response.body.token}}

### Create a quote — Germany, €60,000 gross → 201 + Location
# Burden lines (pension/health/unemployment/care) + Atlas fee + totals, and the
# employer total converted into the org display currency (USD).
# @name createQuote
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "DEU",
  "gross": 60000
}

### Read one quote back by id (the frozen snapshot)
@quoteId = {{createQuote.response.body.id}}
GET {{host}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A big US salary — social-security cap binds, and the fee ceiling (12,000) binds
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "USA",
  "gross": 200000
}

### Unsupported country (well-formed, not onboarded) → 422 domain-rule-violated
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "FRA",
  "gross": 60000
}

### Non-positive gross → 422 domain-rule-violated
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "DEU",
  "gross": 0
}

### List this org's quotes (newest first, cursor pagination)
# Follow the X-Next-Cursor RESPONSE HEADER for the next page.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/quotes?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page (paste the X-Next-Cursor value)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/quotes?limit=2&cursor=PASTE_CURSOR_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Out-of-range limit → 400 invalid-request (rejected, not clamped)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/quotes?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
